{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55404","headline":"十玄谈（幷序） 转位 · 常察","name":"十玄谈（幷序） 转位","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"披毛戴角入鄽来，优鉢罗花火里开。\n烦恼海中爲雨露，无明山上作云雷。\n镬汤炉炭吹教灭，剑树刀山喝使摧。\n金锁玄关留不住，行於异类且轮回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常察","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}